import{_ as t,o as n,c as o,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 837 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One's Guidance of Youth Supremes","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 837 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One's Guidance of Youth Supremes","no":837,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Youth Supreme","Quick-Route","Quest Route","Guidance"],"related":["08-Every-Person-Has-a-Path Guarantee System","37-Symbiotic Education System","23-20% Activation Strategic Plan","713-Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0837_模块4-超脱者与教育-少年至尊指导.md","filePath":"en/0837_模块4-超脱者与教育-少年至尊指导.md"}`),i={name:"en/0837_模块4-超脱者与教育-少年至尊指导.md"};function r(s,e,u,h,l,d){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-837-transcended-ones-and-education-the-transcended-one-s-guidance-of-youth-supremes" tabindex="-1">Entry 837 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One&#39;s Guidance of Youth Supremes <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-837-transcended-ones-and-education-the-transcended-one-s-guidance-of-youth-supremes" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 837 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One&#39;s Guidance of Youth Supremes&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 08, 23, 37, 713</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-sharpest-seedling-most-needs-to-be-led-onto-the-right-road" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the sharpest seedling most needs to be led onto the right road <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-sharpest-seedling-most-needs-to-be-led-onto-the-right-road" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the sharpest seedling most needs to be led onto the right road&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Youth Supreme — a being who in youth already shows extraordinary cultivation talent, breakthrough speed far exceeding peers — is Myriad Ranks&#39; evolution&#39;s sharpest, and also most dangerous, force. The old world had only two attitudes toward Youth Supremes: either snatch them as thugs, cauldrons, &quot;luck-sons&quot; to harvest; or crown them &quot;heaven-chosen,&quot; letting them swell, ultimately letting them grow into new predators. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s attitude is a third: <strong>acknowledge their talent, guide their heart-nature, forge the sharpest seedling into a sword of co-building, not a blade chopped at Myriad Ranks.</strong> This entry specifically discusses how the transcended one guides Youth Supremes, and why this guidance itself is the anti-predation civilization&#39;s key project.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally embody: <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires the Youth Supreme&#39;s talent belong not to him personally, still less to some force, but to Myriad Ranks&#39; public evolutionary resource; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires never treating Youth Supremes as &quot;cauldrons&quot; or &quot;luck&quot; to harvest; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires guidance&#39;s purpose be letting him lift Myriad Ranks forward together, not ascend alone; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires guidance of Youth Supremes throughout traceable, preventing exploitation; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires the &quot;quick + quest&quot; dual-route design itself be self-consistent, not opening back doors for the protagonist by plot needs.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-youth-supremes-are-dangerous" tabindex="-1">I. Why Youth Supremes Are Dangerous <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-youth-supremes-are-dangerous" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Youth Supremes Are Dangerous&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Youth Supreme&#39;s danger is not in his strength, but in his &quot;speed.&quot; The faster the breakthrough, the more easily heart-nature polishing is skipped; the more he is coddled, the more easily &quot;I am extraordinarily talented&quot; is misread as &quot;I may be the exception.&quot; A large number of predatory protagonists in the old world grew up from the Youth Supreme road:</p><ul><li><strong>Short-cut inner demon&#39;s high-incidence zone</strong>: the higher the talent, the more easily &quot;I am special,&quot; &quot;taking short cuts is only natural&quot; greed breeds;</li><li><strong>Monopolizers&#39; prey</strong>: old sects, old clans rush to take him, essentially snatching a &quot;future combat-power asset,&quot; turning him into private property;</li><li><strong>Post-swelling disaster</strong>: if a Youth Supreme reaches the peak quickly without accomplished heart-nature, what backfires is not only him, but the whole plane around him.</li></ul><p>Therefore, <strong>guidance of Youth Supremes the earlier the better</strong> — before his heart-nature solidifies, teach clearly the questions of &quot;where does power come from, where does it go.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-dual-route-design-quick-and-quest-in-parallel" tabindex="-1">II. Dual-Route Design: Quick and Quest in Parallel <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-dual-route-design-quick-and-quest-in-parallel" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Dual-Route Design: Quick and Quest in Parallel&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou adopts for Youth Supremes the &quot;quick + quest&quot; dual route (this is Youth-Supreme-exclusive design, see Module 1 related entries). The transcended one&#39;s guidance is to let these two lines neither be biased nor neglected:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Route</th><th>What It Solves</th><th>How the Transcended One Guides</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Quick route</td><td>Seize the talent window, quickly solidify realms, not waste genius</td><td>Provide optimal textbooks, simulated training, precise Q&amp;A; use the Multiplication Fruit deduction engine to help him avoid detours</td></tr><tr><td>Quest route</td><td>Prevent &quot;fast but empty&quot;; arrange at key nodes slow trials, ordeals, and responsibility</td><td>After his breakthrough, arrange post internship, Myriad-Rank service, independently facing causal trials, polishing heart-nature</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Quick is not spoiling-to-death; quest is not making things difficult. Missing either: only quick raises &quot;strong but without responsibility&quot; monsters; only quest wastes genius&#39;s talent window. The transcended one&#39;s mastery lies in <strong>letting him go fast, while going correctly.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-guidance-s-three-iron-rules" tabindex="-1">III. Guidance&#39;s Three Iron Rules <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-guidance-s-three-iron-rules" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Guidance&#39;s Three Iron Rules&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one guiding Youth Supremes has three insurmountable iron rules:</p><ol><li><strong>Do not feed &quot;exclusive food&quot;</strong>: never treat private resources or private manuals given only to this youth as &quot;cultivation.&quot; What he may learn, other Myriad Ranks may learn; what public resources he may use must be within public standards. Talent may be tilted, but knowledge may not be privately hoarded.</li><li><strong>Do not enclose &quot;uniqueness&quot;</strong>: never tell him &quot;you are heaven-chosen,&quot; &quot;you are the one.&quot; Such words are beings&#39; origin greed · short-cut inner demon&#39;s best nourishment. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants to cultivate is &quot;a leader who runs one step ahead among Myriad Ranks,&quot; not &quot;the sole protagonist.&quot;</li><li><strong>Do not indulge swelling</strong>: if a Youth Supreme shows predatory tendency or corrupt-heart-nature signs, the transcended one has the duty to immediately intervene — suspend his acceleration, arrange heart-nature assessment, if necessary report through Alaya supervision. Guidance is not &quot;accompany him to grow stronger,&quot; but &quot;ensure he goes right.&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="iv-guidance-and-the-20-activation-strategy" tabindex="-1">IV. Guidance and the 20% Activation Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-guidance-and-the-20-activation-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Guidance and the 20% Activation Strategy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Youth Supremes are one of &quot;first activating that 20%&quot; core objects in the 20% Activation Strategy (Document 23). Leading this batch of high-potential seedlings onto the right road early has the highest input-output ratio: a correctly guided Youth Supreme after adulthood may drive his clan and plane&#39;s universal evolution.</p><p>But tilting is not privilege. What Youth Supremes enjoy is &quot;obtaining guidance earlier,&quot; not &quot;monopolizing guidance.&quot; He goes fast because of good talent + correct method; he has no qualification to deprive other slower beings&#39; road — this is the &quot;every person has a path&quot; bottom line entry 839 will discuss.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: guiding Youth Supremes early, directing the sharpest talent to co-building, avoiding genius growing into predators or being harvested by old forces, eliminating the largest talent waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: three iron rules seal the predatory path of &quot;treating Youth Supremes as cauldrons, private property, heaven-chosen to harvest&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: under the Tang-Luo favor system, Youth Supremes through Gu Chensha&#39;s one-time feeding to the top; no fast-slow dual line, no heart-nature assessment; Heng Yuan Zhou uses quick + quest dual route, both protecting talent and polishing heart-nature</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Youth Supremes&#39; talent is viewed as Myriad Ranks&#39; public evolutionary resource; guidance faces each clan&#39;s Youth Supremes, not exclusive to humans</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: textbooks Youth Supremes may learn open network-wide; the tilting he enjoys is a &quot;time window,&quot; not a &quot;knowledge privilege&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-youth-supreme-guidance-s-post-metering-and-supervision" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Youth-Supreme Guidance&#39;s Post Metering and Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-youth-supreme-guidance-s-post-metering-and-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Youth-Supreme Guidance&#39;s Post Metering and Supervision&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This guidance is by no means the transcended one&#39;s momentary whim good deed, but his post duty as a Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm officeholder. Apprentice quotas, guidance duration, heart-nature-assessment pass rate all count into his civilizational weight — guidance proper, Youth Supreme goes right, weight rises; guidance improper, seedling goes astray, weight falls. The entire guidance process leaves traces under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: who is guided by whom, at what node received heart-nature assessment, whether predatory signs appeared, all traceable. This both avoids the transcended one &quot;taking disciples by preference,&quot; and prevents Youth Supremes from being led astray by some master&#39;s bias. The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetually having qualified leaders relies precisely on this metered, supervised guidance system, not on accidentally appearing geniuses.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Youth Supreme is the fastest wind in Myriad Ranks&#39; evolution. The wind itself has no direction; it may blow up harvest, and may also overturn the roof. The transcended one&#39;s guidance of Youth Supremes is to install a rudder on this fastest wind: acknowledge his talent, accelerate his growth, and more nail his heart-nature onto Myriad Ranks&#39; republican right road. When the sharpest seedling is forged into a sword of co-building, not a blade chopped at Myriad Ranks, civilization truly grips its own future.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Every-Person-Has-a-Path Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/23-20%激活战略规划.html">Entry 23 · 20% Activation Strategic Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/37-共生教育体系.html">Entry 37 · Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/713_模块4-万族进化引导岗.html">Entry 713 · Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=t(i,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
